    "wikipedia_summary": "<i>Kohleria hirsuta</i>, the <b>woolly kohleria</b>, is a species of flowering plant in the family Gesneriaceae, native to northern South America, and introduced to the Dominican Republic. In 1993, its synonym <i>Kohleria eriantha</i> gained the Royal Horticultural Society's Award of Garden Merit as a hothouse plant, but this award appears to have been recently revoked.",
